{"id":2081,"level":79,"name":"Напад на зв’язану фігуру (1)","group":"Опануй зв’язку","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>The pin is a dangerous weapon. Yet a pin by itself does not always automatically win material. But a pinned piece is vulnerable because it cannot move. By increasing the pressure on the pinned piece with an additional attacker, it may be possible to win material.</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><b>What do you have to do?&nbsp;</b></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Win material by attacking a pinned piece.&nbsp;</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":91,"examples":[{"fen":"2bq1rk1/1pp2pbp/1rn1pnp1/p2pN1B1/3P4/2PBPQ2/PP1N1PPP/R3K2R w KQ - 0 11","pgn":"11. Ng4 {[%csl Rd8,Gf3,Rf6,Gg4,Gg5,Rg7]} Nxg4 12. Bxd8 * ","text":"<p>Білі можуть посилити тиск на чорного коня за допомогою <strong>1.Ng4! </strong>Чорний не має адекватного захисту від загроз.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"r1b1kb1r/pp3ppp/2n2n2/q2pp1B1/4P3/2N2NP1/PPP2PBP/R2QK2R b KQkq - 0 8","pgn":"{[#]} 8... d4 {[%csl Ga5,Gd4,Re1][%cal Gd4c3,Ga5e1]} 9. O-O dxc3 * ","text":"<p>Білий кінь на c3 зв’язаний. Чорні можуть отримати перевагу за допомогою <strong>1...d4!</strong>, що виграє матеріал.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":77632,"fen":"r2qk2r/pp2bnpp/2p5/3pP2Q/4pP2/7P/PPP4P/R1B1KB1R w KQkq - 0 14","pgn":"{[%csl Re8,Rf7][%evp 0,3,71,61,69,53]} {Q=1} 14. e6 O-O 15. exf7+ * ","format":27,"texts":["Знову атакуйте зв’язану фігуру."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77636,"fen":"2kr3r/ppp1q2p/4nb2/5Q2/3p3P/1P3Pp1/PB4P1/2KR1B1R w - - 0 23","pgn":"{[%csl Rc8,Re6][%evp 0,3,248,268,298,304]} {Q=1} 23. Bc4 Rhe8 {Q=2} 24. Rhe1 (24. Rde1) * ","format":27,"texts":["Attack the pinned piece again. Compare the different options.","Знову атакуйте зв’язану фігуру."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77640,"fen":"r3kbnr/pp1qpppp/2n5/1B3b2/3PpB2/1Q6/PP3PPP/RN2K1NR w KQkq - 0 8","pgn":"{[%csl Rc6,Rd7][%evp 0,4,171,199,248,248,294]} {Q=1} 8. d5 a6 {Q=2} 9. dxc6 *","format"